# --- Promotion determination ---

qa:AG18-QA-002-promotion
    a qa:PromotionDecision ;
    qa:finding qa:AG18-QA-002 ;
    qa:highestOpenBranch "feature/pAG-s21-collapse-dispatch-routing" ;
    qa:promoteToBranch "feature/pAG-s21-collapse-dispatch-routing" ;
    qa:rationale """All four worktrees with real commits (AG.18-AG.21) exhibit the identical open defect: SendResponseEnvelope::{Sent,Acknowledged} remains fully defined, undeprecated, and actively constructed/matched. Per repeatable-pattern policy, the fix is dispatched once to the highest (latest) branch with real commits -- feature/pAG-s21-collapse-dispatch-routing -- and closed on lower branches via merge-forward, not via separate per-branch fix dispatch. AG.21 is dev-in-progress; a new construction site was introduced there during this pass (send/mod.rs:378,382), confirming the pattern is still actively propagating and reinforcing the need to fix at the tip rather than an earlier branch. AG.22-AG.25 are not yet started and are excluded from this sweep; re-sweep required once they carry real commits.""" .
